{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47292","headline":"览古十四首 五 · 吴筠","name":"览古十四首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾观采苓什，复感青蝇诗。\n谗佞乱忠孝，古今同所悲。\n奸邪起狡猾，骨肉相残夷。\n汉储殒江充，晋嗣灭骊姬。\n天性犹可间，君臣固其宜。\n子胥烹吴鼎，文种断越铍。\n屈原沈湘流，厥戚咸自贻。\n何不若范蠡，扁舟无还期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}